					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Qorvo/Decawave DWM3001C fully integrated UWB transceiver module -- combines the Qorvo DW3110 UWB IC, a Nordic nRF52833 BLE MCU, an ST LIS2DH12 accelerometer, an on-module WB007 Dual-Hoe PCB trace monopole UWB antenna, a 38.4MHz reference crystal and power management in one 48-pin castellated module, 19.13x27.1x3.2mm. FiRa compliant, factory calibrated, certified to FCC/ETSI/IC. The DW3110's SPI is wired to the nRF52833 internally, so no UWB SPI bus is exposed -- the module is a self-contained host+radio, replacing the separate NINA-B400 + DWM3000 pair previously used on this board. Single VDD supply: 2.5-3.6V operating (Table 4), 4.0V abs max (Table 9). All pin/electrical data verified directly against the real Qorvo DWM3001C Data Sheet Rev B, May 2022 (Figure 1 'DWM3001C Pin Diagram' and Table 2 'DWM3001C Pin Functions')."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "MPN" "DWM3001C"
			(at 0 0 0)
